[{"pos": "epubcfi(/4/2/4/2/488/6/1:310)", "pos_type": "epubcfi", "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:24:38.211056+00:00", "type": "last-read"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/142/2/1:473", "highlighted_text": " The approach is all about running your own brain", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/142/2/1:424", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:17:19.298Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "J3y8Nb4xanciR_9rIBL_2w"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/144/2/1:403", "highlighted_text": "You are a data collecting being", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/144/2/1:372", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:18:23.324Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "WwdlLE35XJ190EQJIrRjmg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/146/2/1:258", "highlighted_text": "Educators have said that understanding is the key to learning but how can you understand something if you can’t remember it?", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/146/2/1:134", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:19:42.828Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "TbhktDFOIDJh2lWuko2HLA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/146/2/1:497", "highlighted_text": "We have all had this experience: we recognize and understand information but can’t recall it when we need it. For example, how many jokes do you know? You’ve probably heard thousands, but you can only recall about four or five right now. ", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/146/2/1:259", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:20:28.594Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "dOjV7fToX5TgVh5cBWy3LA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/146/2/1:741", "highlighted_text": "Understanding doesn’t create use: only when you can instantly recall what you understand, and practise using your remembered understanding", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/146/2/1:603", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:21:34.234Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "0NpoWF6xfgD7BfpOfsLNzw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/146/2/1:870", "highlighted_text": "Memory means storing what you have learned; otherwise, why would we bother learning in the first place?", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/146/2/1:767", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:22:40.125Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "Jv4HHWRgeWGLscdznMRJeg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/148/4/1:42", "highlighted_text": "you need facts.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/148/4/1:27", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:27:26.400Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "aEWIwuItWCfhGy2knTjoIQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/150/2/1:251", "highlighted_text": "people that are certain about what they know.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/150/2/1:206", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:27:31.451Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "ZVsYTHZIhOOQpGsYSRPqTQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/152/2/1:120", "highlighted_text": "Memory is the corner stone of our existence. It determines the quality of our decisions and, therefore, our entire life!", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/152/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:27:37.825Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "wfLM7UvGaPIYtIfwpi1TvQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/154/2/1:339", "highlighted_text": "deep hole never to be used again.", "notes": "why we learn things, why we know things, to use it in our life. Gidence of what we gonna do in this life.\n\nMeaning: you need facts decision of what to do, with your life.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/154/2/1:306", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:38:46.065Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "cNuKUuinRLaRIs3cApShyQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/154/2/1:183", "highlighted_text": "memory holds the new information in place over time.", "notes": "over time - joto use korba", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/154/2/1:131", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:37:07.705Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "8oWXIG0SwIsHZcInJT5xPA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/156/2/1:176", "highlighted_text": "You can access information more quickly and more easily – creating greater opportunities for connections and associations.", "notes": "Skolor can connect problems", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/156/2/1:54", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:40:21.151Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "NQhtKViQkUrtKCpDPViPbw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/156/2/1:681", "highlighted_text": "Information can only be built onto more information, so the more you know the easier it is to get to know more.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/156/2/1:570", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:41:53.697Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "FEbfVaPuuCAJB1lHPWRrrw"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:43:11.250Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "r0UGMOXSzzE4RybuvRZhgw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/156/2/1:322", "highlighted_text": " The more facts and memories that you have properly stored in your brain, the more potential you have to make unique combinations and connections.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/156/2/1:176", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:43:26.183Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "NdA3uJojVP19vmjjkZNAcw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/156/2/1:466", "highlighted_text": "intelligence is based on all of the events, people, and facts that you can recall.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/156/2/1:384", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:43:35.618Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "YozN6GspThxxeEV16tl54Q"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/160/2/1:317", "highlighted_text": "I couldn’t concentrate; reading and writing were always a challenge for me.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/160/2/1:242", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:45:50.733Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "Bh7Omw8LmaceL-6sRXySCQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/162/18/1:165", "highlighted_text": "discovered that we all have a second choice. This choice is: our memory is just a habit, and habits can be improved with the right kind of training and practice.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/162/18/1:4", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:34:55.965Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "hdBErPJzkIXsB48WXLPqPQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/162/18/1:683", "highlighted_text": "took myself to a point where I was reading and taking in", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/162/18/1:627", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2024-11-15T07:51:01.835Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "zmTI6Q0IFEkzee3diIXFew"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/162/18/1:557", "highlighted_text": "could get my hands on in the areas of the brain, mind, and memory. I studied hundreds of books and tapes, and I also interviewed people with great memories", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/162/18/1:402", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:35:07.234Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "5PwE3yNWMEAUW2n5CWBLNw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/162/2/1:246", "highlighted_text": "Tony Buzan.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/162/2/1:235", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "yellow"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T13:01:14.166Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "vOAI7vc0yGxMqX6HLhqo7A"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T13:03:09.920Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "C8cj0F5vgEmVOoHO5Ew0Cg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/166/2/1:679", "highlighted_text": " Mainly because people said it was impossible to do,", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/166/2/1:627", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T13:04:59.892Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "BWQIdsYpSmYW5rNqnoTEQg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/168/2/1:359", "highlighted_text": "Many people say I have a photographic memory, but that is not true. I have just discovered many ‘secrets’ about memory, and I have been able to use and make these methods my own.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/168/2/1:181", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:36:49.351Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "WBAf9BnbSAYBSGTew3nX-g"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/170/2/1:322", "highlighted_text": "if you keep on doing what you have always done, you are going to get what you have always gotten.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/170/2/1:225", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T13:06:10.282Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "oJnE0BbLJXP061s0bGu1qg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/172/2/1:72", "highlighted_text": "Don’t judge or look for perfection from this book; rather look for value", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/172/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T13:20:28.363Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "idzwQFBtCqIoJyO3BAl5NA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/176/2/1:95", "highlighted_text": "I will teach you to transform bland information into something that is real and well organized.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/176/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:36:57.893Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "Sku3EFpcUNKU40IaX3CUnQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/176/2/1:350", "highlighted_text": "The goal is to improve learning and understanding.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/176/2/1:300", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T15:29:50.126Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 1. Introduction"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "v1RHaoHgyV2WFtdMP_5PZQ"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T15:30:47.643Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "Rkzrg71vX6g-hIiwAikFRw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/188/2/1:67", "highlighted_text": "subject of concentration", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/188/2/1:43", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T15:30:53.458Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Part 1. Concentrate"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "iq8H3SWNt_zt6UVicdGVmg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/188/2/1:99", "highlighted_text": "Wherever you are, be there.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/188/2/1:72", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T15:31:02.630Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Part 1. Concentrate"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "vqmr9_7vVp6bqEkmF88xuA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/210/2/1:95", "highlighted_text": "Take time to really think about your excuses and write them down.\n\nThese are the same excuses that you use every time to stop yourself from learning anything new.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/208/2/1:233", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-12T15:32:45.051Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 2. Excuse me"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "6WYWXCeuSNLrta9drOwsWQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/432/2/1:428", "highlighted_text": "You have everything in you now to take control of your bouncing monkey mind and to take your power back.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/432/2/1:324", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:04:40.344Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "6GY78LKmpUVaQEx8rdaXcg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/428/2/1:183", "highlighted_text": "You can focus your thinking to improve any area of your life; you are in control of what you choose to attend to.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/428/2/1:70", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:05:08.311Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "Y1Lj7Ha22AgSeUMbU3K7Xg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/422/2/1:51", "highlighted_text": "Concentrate all your thoughts on the task at hand.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/422/2/1:1", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:05:20.977Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "AnGPVQ2FJE8NzJqPJHsGAA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/422/2/1:103", "highlighted_text": "do not burn until brought to a focus", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/422/2/1:67", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:05:33.279Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "4dx6Kx42wu-I7j6omedrIg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/436", "highlighted_text": "we allow our attention to be pulled in different directions.\n\n", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/434/2/1:873", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:43:18.261Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "XWR17cLu2FYI4ZklQlwcvg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/436/2/1:285", "highlighted_text": "We keep on switching through the channels of our minds and never stop long enough on one specific channel.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/436/2/1:179", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:08:21.628Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "ThG_tudN0LFWNS5JiTxfcg"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:09:51.030Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "Jha9SmQWaOdM9rfUnHdGQQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/436/2/1:356", "highlighted_text": "We pay attention half-heartedly on almost everything we do these days.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/436/2/1:286", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:09:15.309Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "3W-VUzFXQ1lnGXsDL_OwGw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/438/4/1:60", "highlighted_text": "You just have to learn to become more peaceful and find the moment. You have to learn to be here now. When you are at work, be at work. When you are at home, be at home. “Learn to be silent. Let your quiet mind listen and absorb,”", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/438/2/1:45", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:12:09.410Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "j018nCANAG1KJ-nwc8DM0A"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/2/1:48", "highlighted_text": "We fill our minds up with all kinds of conflict,", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:12:32.375Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "kmFJ4HCGDGmy7_2zUysiqw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/2/1:88", "highlighted_text": "takes us away from the moment.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/2/1:58", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:12:43.057Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "Auy-yeV7sljtYM_7U4tbOg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/2/1:321", "highlighted_text": "when you fill your mind with conflict, your mind will be all over the place.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/2/1:245", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:13:52.244Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "bnnpvMwwOR81Myx-iccGiA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/442/2/1:43", "highlighted_text": "When you are peaceful, you enjoy the moment", "notes": "**", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/442/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:15:02.283Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "McqYtu9df-ESUtgipRhpYw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/442/2/1:128", "highlighted_text": "your mind becomes like a laser beam. Peace and concentration are the same thing.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/442/2/1:48", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:15:16.158Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "lyuWsHiw8t6DT-MoVLudPQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/450/2/1:44", "highlighted_text": "where did you concentrate well today?", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/450/2/1:7", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:16:16.493Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "_CmHb9JaH0o6RnwyoEFf6w"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/452/2/1:82", "highlighted_text": "Your inner voice has the ability to offer instructions so instruct yourself well. ", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/452/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:16:41.065Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "nD9df8U4R29ngUPgY07LYg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/452/2/1:240", "highlighted_text": "It is the center of your focus of control that helps you explain and make sense of your world. Don’t agree with the wrong voices; all self-hatred and conflict", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/452/2/1:82", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:18:28.367Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "Nwgq-A9LN-zLpSRv8mVQlw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/456/2/1:99", "highlighted_text": "Multitasking is a myth!", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/456/2/1:76", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:19:14.674Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "OfSVZEIL3eaxJM3-QIkA3A"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/458/2/1:247", "highlighted_text": "She is single minded and does everything in her power to achieve her goal.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/458/2/1:173", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:09:34.734Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "xr7mIy3Dlv3bWHDN4EfKMg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/458/2/1:749", "highlighted_text": "Our brain can really only focus on one thing at a time. It is impossible to focus on two things at the same time. When you are multitasking, you are actually switching between tasks, you are always semi-attending, and it is not very effective.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/458/2/1:506", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:09:38.386Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "JGyRo7o2FwMlT1M3kOTwKw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/458/2/1:798", "highlighted_text": "do more than one thing well at a time.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/458/2/1:760", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:09:49.454Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "es5sU9TlsPDtyFFex4Dedg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/458/2/1:759", "highlighted_text": "We cannot", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/458/2/1:750", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:09:45.207Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "bOQt2qCYnJG3iMmDdCmH-A"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/462/6/1:157", "highlighted_text": "makes you less creative", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/462/6/1:134", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2025-06-17T19:22:28.739Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "pIZvO597dIqsc-3QzXQTdw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/466/2/1:494", "highlighted_text": "We are also not allowing ourselves to sit and enjoy the moment anymore. Blaise Pascal said, “All man’s miseries derive from not being able to sit quietly in a room alone.” We get in the car, and we have to put the radio on. When we arrive home we have to put the TV on. When we watch TV, we flip through the channels. We even lack enough attention to watch the commercials. We are constantly filling our minds with conflict. Most people allow their attention to be pulled in different directions; very few people direct their attention. A lack of attention direction is the real disorder.\n\nStop overwhelming yourself by continually changing the channels of your mind. Sharpen up your intellect by returning to the habit of doing one thing at a time. Rediscover the value of consecutive tasking, instead of settling for the quality dilution associated with simultaneous tasking. Exceptional work is always associated with periods of deep concentration. Nothing excellent ever comes from a scattered effort. When you are all there, your brain power and resources will be all there, too.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/464/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:11:18.560Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "eW4zV5W9gkhOy0ruy4lA7A"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:11:18.560Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "K6LrpHw0JAHtRNIinl6EZA"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:11:18.560Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "ATRVsB-ZmeDB-Ek_pSnvPQ"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:11:18.560Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "GW6GYZccJNBTpyukuuCN0Q"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:11:18.560Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "jg5lJlkuBqHjzSS-1qkyKA"}, {"removed": true, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:11:18.560Z", "type": "highlight", "uuid": "JJhNLHjZtmBSsqPRBEa_LQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/432/2/1:177", "highlighted_text": "Concentration is made up of many small choices consistently practised. Everyday brain research is telling us that the brain is consistently changing when we learn something new.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/432/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:40:01.051Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "_DKx-Mxen5ldt2a2KLD1TA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/434/2/1:872", "highlighted_text": "won’t change; yet, they think it should change. In fact, we worry and focus our attention on a ‘million’ things which can all wait for the appropriate time, but", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/434/2/1:712", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:43:29.823Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "-S9bYW_HNEL-XdmMCq1adQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/2/1:243", "highlighted_text": "Conflict pulls your mind in many directions", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/2/1:200", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:46:20.170Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "xBmFBYyn3Pad8w8qqK7brw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/4/1:42", "highlighted_text": "Conflict is the opposite of concentration.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/440/4/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "blue"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-06T23:46:24.370Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "JhY908l14cme2ux8pwthsQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/470/2/1:112", "highlighted_text": "When people approach information they never really know what they want out of it. They don’t direct their minds.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/470/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:13:57.172Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "EI-wgJRtAZE0ol7sPCgWUw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/4/1:195", "highlighted_text": "P urpose: Having a clear purpose is important because clarity dissolves resistance. Always remember why you are reading or learning the information. Keep your purpose at the forefront of your mind.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:14:09.691Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "0dK8MsOkZxzMxb7vekaZDA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/4/1:271", "highlighted_text": "If you don’t know what you want, how are you going to know when you get it?", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/4/1:196", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:14:48.395Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "2g4HiffgB3X03XU2FM-c-A"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/4/1:442", "highlighted_text": "Learning with a purpose increases your attention, comprehension, retention, and organizes your thoughts. The more specific the purpose, the more information you will get.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/4/1:272", "style": {"kind": "decoration", "type": "builtin", "which": "wavy"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:15:25.819Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "WQ1h3ZE13NKGpEd6UPaCsQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/4/1:712", "highlighted_text": " I want to learn at least six key strategies that will enable me to improve my memory. Focus on getting information that you can use – and then put it into practice.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/4/1:547", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:17:14.466Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "4KIDQPcWJOuRgd3AHDNvGA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/6/1:79", "highlighted_text": "“If you’re not sure why you’re doing something, you can never do enough of it.”", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/472/6/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:17:18.747Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "vIgiw5hkXJIyzpTPh9DNvg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/474/4/1:363", "highlighted_text": "Whatever is highest on your interest list is where your mind is alert, disciplined, and focused. Whatever is lower on your interest list is where you hesitate and procrastinate.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/474/4/1:186", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:17:53.815Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "LnJ4jH2qRi40ANo-9QMCDQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/474/4/1:132", "highlighted_text": "I nterest: Your level of interest sets the direction of your attention and, therefore, your level of focus. If you are not interested,", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/474/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:18:02.636Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "gw1RTFkWEx63cbBmR6tKpQ"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/476/2/1:201", "highlighted_text": "You can remember mountains of information when you are interested in the subject. It almost feels automatic and your concentration is at a peak. Your deficits of attention are mostly interest deficits.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/476/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:18:39.388Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "HKwkaAYB0ML5ziB3tS50aA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/476/4/1:92", "highlighted_text": "Your mind never wanders away; it only moves towards more interesting and outstanding things.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/476/4/1:0", "style": {"kind": "decoration", "type": "builtin", "which": "wavy"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:18:44.122Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "P6SHwqJQTuwmvVF2QYJmAg"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/478/2/1:683", "highlighted_text": "I’m interested in training and sharing knowledge with other people. When I read anything I’m always searching for new information relating to my interest. When I read or listen through my interest filter, I am focused and I can concentrate. I always ask myself questions like, “How does this connect to training? How is it going to improve my life? If I read or remember this, is it going to give me something that", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/478/2/1:269", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:19:39.667Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "STXF7jRlwirZbpPaujmfPA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/478/2/1:793", "highlighted_text": "How does this material help me achieve my goals?”", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/478/2/1:744", "style": {"kind": "decoration", "type": "builtin", "which": "wavy"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:19:58.874Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "X50g0VXLELj0cJPQQB06fw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/478/2/1:743", "highlighted_text": "not many people know? Is it going to help me in the future?", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/478/2/1:684", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:20:03.831Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "34XTOxMAe1fUQMrMt_qNcw"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/480/4/1:799", "highlighted_text": "You want to ask energy enhancing questions that get you engaged in the information. Ask yourself, “How is this relevant and applicable to my life right now? How will this information help me achieve my goals? How can I apply this information to improve my work? How will this help me? How will this information make me more significant?” Get curious about your mind and how it works.", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/480/4/1:416", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:21:20.610Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "NmeqXch9kKr951Tn-aZUYA"}, {"end_cfi": "/2/4/2/486/6/1:39", "highlighted_text": "Imagine one day you woke up and you didn't have to worry. What would you feel like? You would be peaceful; there would be no thoughts moving through your mind. No thoughts sending stress emotions through your system.\n\nImagine waking up and you didn't have to run or control other people’s behaviors", "spine_index": 1, "spine_name": "OEBPS/text00000.html", "start_cfi": "/2/4/2/484/2/1:0", "style": {"kind": "color", "type": "builtin", "which": "green"}, "timestamp": "2026-03-07T03:22:42.119Z", "toc_family_titles": ["Chapter 4. Be here now"], "type": "highlight", "uuid": "6JgRtCMIlCiGU2c5apj4HQ"}]